{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>香港天文台於今日（11月17日）下午5時發出特別天氣提示，指出一道冷鋒已在華南北部形成，並將於明日（11月18日）稍後橫過廣東沿岸。本港今晚將有一兩陣雨，氣溫逐漸下降，市民需注意天氣變化。\n</p>\n<p>隨後一兩日，香港天氣將顯著轉涼，市區最低氣溫預計在15至16度，新界地區則可能再低兩至三度。受強烈東北季候風影響，星期五及星期六初時高地風寒效應尤為明顯，戶外活動人士需特別留意寒冷天氣。</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民，應注意保暖，尤其是長者及慢性病患者，需額外關注其健康狀況。進行戶外活動的人士應穿著適當的保暖衣物，並留意最新天氣預報，以確保安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%86%b7%e9%8b%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">冷鋒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:11:37.228577+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:00:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:06:22.361857+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:54.747290+00:00","content_hash":"ad042f3d71d80b6d31fcb19d1480c12b42e0fc799e62049bd343e29ee1869c70","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}